## Key Concepts Covered

| Concept | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Local Route** | Default route in every VPC route table enabling intra-VPC communication (no NAT/IGW needed) |
| **Private Subnet Route Table** | Routes 0.0.0.0/0 to NAT Gateway for outbound internet access |
| **Public Subnet Route Table** | Routes 0.0.0.0/0 to Internet Gateway |
| **NAT Gateway** | Managed NAT in a **public subnet**; enables outbound-only internet for private resources |
| **Internet Gateway (IGW)** | VPC-level gateway for bidirectional internet traffic; attached to the VPC |

