## NAT Gateway vs Internet Gateway — Quick Comparison

| Feature | NAT Gateway | Internet Gateway |
|---------|-------------|------------------|
| **Direction** | Outbound-only (initiated from private) | Bidirectional |
| **Placement** | Public subnet (one per AZ for HA) | VPC-level (one per VPC) |
| **Use Case** | Private instances needing internet access | Public instances, NAT GW egress, VPN/DX |
| **IP Address** | Elastic IP (static) | AWS-managed |
| **Cost** | Per-hour + data processing | Free (data transfer charges apply) |

